  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.66.3 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Fixes 🔧\n* Fix removing a submodule in a linked worktree breaking the submodule in the main worktree by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6186\n* Ignore submodules whose name or path in .gitmodules leads outside the repository by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6187\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/compare/v0.66.2...v0.66.3\n\n",
